      ],
      "source_url": "https://github.com/flutter/samples/tree/21c71902bb2c7da3cce328ba5946cba2f35a660a",
      "summary": "The Material 3 demo switches between compact, medium and large layouts using available width, and pairs a NavigationBar with a NavigationRail. It is an SDK-widget reference rather than a discontinued adaptive-scaffold package.",
