        "foldable"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://github.com/android/compose-samples/tree/25631e8f544a9a1e3f01e296eaf1b4c28428196c",
      "summary": "Reply turns compact windows into a single mail pane and expanded windows into list-detail panes. Its concrete source maps FoldingFeature bounds to book/separating postures and passes display features into Accompanist TwoPane.",
