      "guidance": "Use this as a study of selection feedback, not as permission to make primary navigation depend on a bouncing ornament. Provide visible destination labels, VoiceOver names and selected-state semantics, and maintain 44pt effective tap areas with enough separation. Test long localized labels and accessibility text on the narrowest iPhone. For larger windows prefer the host app standard adaptive tab/sidebar navigation unless the custom bar truly fits. Supply a standard static TabView fallback for Reduce Motion rather than assuming all library animations honor the environment. Retain the attribution to Exyte, Alisa Mylnikova and original design inspiration Yeasin Arafat. No promotional GIFs, screenshots or remote media were copied; source licensing does not license those images.",
